00:32:56.190 --> 00:33:01.730
It's Gino and Leo from Vance Refrigeration, played by Gene Stepnitzky and Lee Eisenberg,

715
00:33:01.870 --> 00:33:02.530
our two writers.

716
00:33:04.190 --> 00:33:05.930
They were perfect as those guys.

717
00:33:06.190 --> 00:33:10.030
I don't know if that's a compliment or not, but they were great as those two idiots.

718
00:33:10.590 --> 00:33:14.350
Well, Phyllis tells Kevin, you need to go get more barbecue sauce.

