00:33:15.150 --> 00:33:18.550
There was a deleted scene where Angela's like, Phyllis, I got it.

721
00:33:18.630 --> 00:33:19.130
No problem.

722
00:33:19.530 --> 00:33:20.630
She's like, really?

723
00:33:20.790 --> 00:33:22.630
She's like, yeah, I'll get the barbecue sauce.

724
00:33:22.750 --> 00:33:23.590
Don't worry about it.

725
00:33:24.030 --> 00:33:26.350
And Phyllis is like, oh, okay, thanks.

726
00:33:26.850 --> 00:33:29.390
And then Angela never goes and gets the barbecue sauce.

