00:33:40.450 --> 00:33:42.250
Phyllis is like, so ticked.

731
00:33:42.250 --> 00:33:46.790
And that's when she goes to Kevin and says, Kevin, can you go get the barbecue sauce?

732
00:33:46.990 --> 00:33:52.950
So there's a lot of deleted Phyllis and Angela in this episode that really, really ratchets

733
00:33:52.950 --> 00:33:56.070
up Phyllis's pissed offness towards Angela.

734
00:33:56.370 --> 00:33:57.950
You know what that is from Angela?

735
00:33:58.430 --> 00:34:00.370
That's some sandwich right there.

736
00:34:01.590 --> 00:34:02.150
Sabotage.

737
00:34:02.990 --> 00:34:03.550
Sabotage.

738
00:34:03.950 --> 00:34:04.510
Yeah.

739
00:34:05.170 --> 00:34:07.250
It's time for Michael's big speech.

