00:34:15.190 --> 00:34:15.970
Oh, wait, wait.

745
00:34:16.170 --> 00:34:22.690
First of all, he makes a huge thank you to Phyllis for throwing the best party they've

746
00:34:22.690 --> 00:34:25.270
ever had at 29, 22 seconds.

747
00:34:25.290 --> 00:34:29.690
This might be the biggest Angela eye roll of the whole entire series.

748
00:34:30.130 --> 00:34:30.250
Yeah.

749
00:34:30.690 --> 00:34:32.790
It's a full body eye roll.

750
00:34:33.010 --> 00:34:36.650
Angela, I'm going to say something to you right now, and you're just going to have to

