00:34:36.650 --> 00:34:37.090
hear it.

752
00:34:37.230 --> 00:34:37.450
What?

753
00:34:37.570 --> 00:34:38.450
He's not wrong.

754
00:34:38.830 --> 00:34:41.270
This is the best party.

755
00:34:41.390 --> 00:34:42.510
It's the best party.

756
00:34:42.710 --> 00:34:43.370
Okay, fine.

757
00:34:43.690 --> 00:34:48.210
Outside of maybe casino night, where I think maybe Michael hired, you know, a professional

