00:34:48.210 --> 00:34:49.930
party committee or something.

759
00:34:50.210 --> 00:34:53.950
But for a homemade office party, Phyllis nailed it.

760
00:34:54.070 --> 00:34:54.730
It's great.

761
00:34:55.110 --> 00:34:55.810
She did.

762
00:34:55.970 --> 00:34:56.470
She nailed it.

763
